    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the quiet doesnt really help though... it just gives me more time to think about how much i hate this cycle. it's not just being sleepy, it's like my soul is just done. i feel like i've reached the end of my rope and there's no more rope left. everything feels so pointless.",
